                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "\"You are a pilot of the spaceship 'Znkl-177'. You need to deliver a capsule with important information to the cargo spaceship.\"\n\nThat sounds easier than it is (at least for me). \nThis is not a typical 2D space shooter, as your spaceship can only move up and down along the left edge of the screen. The path through space to the cargo ship is blocked by various clever obstacles, and it is a lot of fun to figure out how to successfully shoot the capsule there by using detours and trick shots.\n\nI really like this game because it's totally relaxing, especially with this music and these beautiful backgrounds, but at the same time, it's exciting to figure out the solution through trial and error. I can absolutely recommend this game!\n\nI also created a video for it. Unfortunately, it only starts from level 18, but it might still be very helpful, especially since the levels naturally get much harder towards the end and I created timestamps for your convenience. Besides, it is worth checking out just for the meditative music alone.\n\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3822293587",
